2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjv0eHzytKWAxXli68BHdQaDZAQ3IcHCFUoCw",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2025/12/15 晚上前來用餐\n\n搶先體驗一下並發表評論\n\n簡單說說好了\n\n需要在打磨一下 可能剛開幕的原因\n\n用QR叩點餐 簡簡單單 有加麵選項\n\n可調整軟硬 以及特殊要求\n\n這次點了個招牌豚骨/麵硬\n\n滿分五分\n味道：3分\n麵條：2.5分\n配料：5分\n\n先說湯頭 湯頭部分豚骨味道幾乎都被油的味道蓋過去，吃不出個所以然，沒有豚骨的味道\n那層油很厚，吃下去油味大於豚骨味。\n\n麵條，點了個麵硬沒有我想像中的那麼硬，吃起來感覺是適中，可能我平常吃的更硬吧。\n\n配料，木耳，筍乾，溏心蛋，味道都好讚喔\n說不出來的感覺味道很重我喜歡。\n\n以上我的個人看法及口味\n\n環境位置很多，還有可以接6人團體左右的半包廂，有吧台有一般座位，但配料餐具區在另一邊 第一次去會找不到 笑。\n\n整體來說是需要在打磨一下\n\n店員服務還可以 有問必答 不會擺臭臉的那種\n\n加油加油 祝生意興隆",null,[0,30]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12920591532604003813/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUldKdVpGRlBSR1JYV1Zad1ZscHNWbEpOYWtKYVV6SldVMVl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12920591532604003813/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUldKdVpGRlBSR1JYV1Zad1ZscHNWbEpOYWtKYVV6SldVMVl3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12920591532604003813/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUldKdVpGRlBSR1JYV1Zad1ZscHNWbEpOYWtKYVV6SldVMVl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12920591532604003813/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUldKdVpGRlBSR1JYV1Zad1ZscHNWbEpOYWtKYVV6SldVMVl3UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12920591532604003813/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUldKdVpGRlBSR1JYV1Zad1ZscHNWbEpOYWtKYVV6SldVMVl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12920591532604003813/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUldKdVpGRlBSR1JYV1Zad1ZscHNWbEpOYWtKYVV6SldVMVl3UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7617,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kRWJuZFFPRGRXWVZwVlpsVlJNakJaUzJWU1YwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xca67a2503067